      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOBBY BONUS (5) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the money the last five starts, the latest when third (17.23) at Casino. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Makes plenty of appeal. ULTIMATE FLOYD (1) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start sixth (20.43) at Q Lakeside. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. KICK IT OFF (8) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at Casino over 300m behind Impeccable (17.59) in a Mix 3/4. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can do much better this time. JUST DOUG (2) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
